cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in your research, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "match-stream"
abstract: "Out-of-core matching for large data: nearest-neighbor matching with or without replacement, calipers, exact strata, Mahalanobis, kernel, ridge and coarsened exact matching, with Abadie-Imbens inference. Conventions follow R's MatchIt; results are tested against MatchIt and Matching."
authors:
